    "- `tir` (Time-In-Range 70–180) — the standard clinical target (>70%); a single number that aligns with diabetes guidelines.\n",
    "- `tbr` / `tar` — Time-Below-Range and Time-Above-Range break the tail risks apart; tbr is the more dangerous one acutely."
